        rdfs:comment "characterization of the transaction. \"POJISTNE\": stands for insurrance payment \"SLUZBY\": stands for payment for statement \"UROK\": stands for interest credited \"SANKC. UROK\": sanction interest if negative balance \"SIPO\": stands for household \"DUCHOD\": stands for old-age pension \"UVER\": stands for loan payment"@en ] ;
